r></thead><tbody data-start="1297" data-end="2049"><tr data-start="1297" data-end="1372"><td data-start="1297" data-end="1322" data-col-size="sm">同义词</td><td data-start="1322" data-end="1372" data-col-size="md">2-羟基-N, N, N-三甲基乙铵氯化物</td></tr><tr data-start="1373" data-end="1409"><td data-start="1373" data-end="1398" data-col-size="sm">化学文摘社编号</td><td data-start="1398" data-end="1409" data-col-size="md">67-48-1</td></tr><tr data-start="1410" data-end="1458"><td data-start="1410" data-end="1435" data-col-size="sm">分子式</td><td data-start="1435" data-end="1458" data-col-size="md">[HOCH₂CH₂(CH₃)₃N]Cl</td></tr><tr data-start="1459" data-end="1500"><td data-start="1459" data-end="1484" data-col-size="sm">分子量</td><td data-start="1484" data-end="1500" data-col-size="md">139.63 克/摩尔</td></tr><tr data-start="1501" data-end="1564"><td data-start="1501" data-end="1526" data-col-size="sm">外观</td><td data-start="1526" data-end="1564" data-col-size="md">自由流动的浅棕色颗粒</td></tr><tr data-start="1565" data-end="1611"><td data-start="1565" data-end="1590" data-col-size="sm">气味</td><td data-start="1590" data-end="1611" data-col-size="md">轻微胺味</td></tr><tr data-start="1612" data-end="1649"><td data-start="1612" data-end="1637" data-col-size="sm">承运人</td><td data-start="1637" data-end="1649" data-col-size="md">玉米棒</td></tr><tr data-start="1650" data-end="1712"><td data-start="1650" data-end="1677" data-col-size="sm">氯化胆碱含量</td><td data-start="1677" data-end="1712" data-col-size="md">≥60%（≈52% 纯胆碱）</td></tr><tr data-start="1713" data-end="1748"><td data-start="1713" data-end="1738" data-col-size="sm">干燥损失</td><td data-start="1738" data-end="1748" data-col-size="md">≤ 2.0%</td></tr><tr data-start="1749" data-end="1787"><td data-start="1749" data-end="1774" data-col-size="sm">三甲胺（TMA）</td><td data-start="1774" data-end="1787" data-col-size="md">≤ 300 ppm</td></tr><tr data-start="1788" data-end="1827"><td data-start="1788" data-end="1813" data-col-size="sm">表观密度</td><td data-start="1813" data-end="1827" data-col-size="md">~500 千克/立方米</td></tr><tr data-start="1828" data-end="1884"><td data-start="1828" data-end="1853" data-col-size="sm">颗粒大小</td><td data-start="1853" data-end="1884" data-col-size="md">≥ 95% 通过 20 目筛</td></tr><tr data-start="1885" data-end="1953"><td data-start="1885" data-end="1910" data-col-size="sm">保质期</td><td data-start="1910" data-end="1953" data-col-size="md">18 个月（≤25°C 的阴凉干燥环境下储存）</td></tr><tr data-start="1954" data-end="2049"><td data-start="1954" data-end="1979" data-col-size="sm">包装选项</td><td data-start="1979" data-end="2049" data-col-size="md">25 千克牛皮纸袋 + PE 内衬 / 625 千克巨型袋 / 客户定制选项</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><hr data-start="2051" data-end="2054" /><h2 data-start="2056" data-end="2100">主要功能和优点</h2><ul data-start="2101" data-end="2724"><li data-start="2101" data-end="2197"><p data-start="2103" data-end="2197"><strong data-start="2103" data-end="2134">作为饲料添加剂的高活性胆碱含量</strong>:确保高效配制，降低含杂率。</p></li><li data-start="2198" data-end="2284"><p data-start="2200" data-end="2284"><strong data-start="2200" data-end="2219">成本效益</strong>:降低单位活性成分的运输和储存成本。</p></li><li data-start="2285" data-end="2403"><p data-start="2287" data-end="2403"><strong data-start="2287" data-end="2307">饲料性能</strong>:预防脂肪肝，提高生长速度、繁殖力、产蛋量和饲料转化率。</p></li><li data-start="2404" data-end="2501"><p data-start="2406" data-end="2501"><strong data-start="2406" data-end="2426">易于操作</strong>:自由流动的颗粒，是预混料和直接混合饲料的理想选择。</p></li><li data-start="2502" data-end="2628"><p data-start="2504" data-end="2628"><strong data-start="2504" data-end="2529">监管合规</strong>:根据 <strong data-start="2546" data-end="2587">ISO 9001、FAMI-QS 和 GB/T 标准</strong> 国际饲料添加剂贸易。</p></li><li data-start="2629" data-end="2724"><p data-start="2631" data-end="2724"><strong data-start="2631" data-end="2656">灵活的供应链</strong>:多种包装形式，既适合小规模采购商，也适合大宗采购商。</p></li></ul><hr data-start="2726" data-end="2729" /><h2 data-start="2731" data-end="2766">按动物种类分类</h2><ul data-start="2768" data-end="3193"><li data-start="2768" da